{
  "title": "Ziyarat of Imam Ali al-Naqi al-Hadi (a.s.) — Samarra",
  "data": "Common Izn Dukhool\nSpecific Izn Dukhool |\nZiyarat\nSpecific Recitation at the entrance\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا نَبِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA NABIYYAL LAAHE\nMay I enter, O Prophet of Allah?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا امِيرَ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA AMEERAL MOAMENEENA\nMay I enter, O Commander of the Faithful?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا فَاطِمَةُ الزَّهْرَاءُ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA FAATEMATUZ ZAHRAAA-O\nMay I enter, O Fatimah the luminous\nسَيِّدَةَ نِسَاءِ الْعَالَمِينَ\nSAYYEDATA NESAAA-IL A’ALAMEENA\nand the doyenne of the women of the world?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ الْحَسَنُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYAL HASANUBNA A’LIYYIN\nMay I enter, O my master al-Hasan the son of Ali?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ الْحُسَيْنُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYAL HOSAYNUBNA A’LIYYIN\nMay I enter, O my master al-Husayn the son of Ali?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ عَلِيُّ بْنَ الْحُسَيْنِ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA A’LIYYUBNAL HOSAYNE\nMay I enter, O my master Ali the son of al-Husayn?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ مُحَمَّدُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA MOHAMMADUBNA A’LIYYIN\nMay I enter, O my master Muhammad the son of Ali?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ جَعْفَرُ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA JA’FARUBNA MOHAMMADIN\nMay I enter, O my master Ja`far the son of Muhammad?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ مُوسَىٰ بْنَ جَعْفَرٍ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA MOOSABNA JA’FARIN\nMay I enter, O my master Musa the son of Ja`far?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ عَلِيُّ بْنَ مُوسَىٰ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA A’LIYYUBNA MOOSAA\nMay I enter, O my master Ali the son of Musa?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ مُحَمَّدُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA MOHAMMADUBNA A’LIYYIN\nMay I enter, O my master Muhammad the son of Ali?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ يَا اَبَا الْحَسَنِ عَلِيُّ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAL HASANE A’LIYYUBNA MOHAMMADIN\nMay I enter, O my master Abul-Hasan Ali the son of Muhammad?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَوْلَايَ يَا اَبَا مُحَمَّدٍ الْحَسَنُ بْنَ عَلِيٍّ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAA MOHAMMADENIL HASANUBNA A’LIYYIN\nMay I enter, O my master Abu-Muhammad al-Hasan the son of Ali?\nءَاَدْخُلُ يَا مَلَائِكَةَ اللّٰهِ\nA-ADKHOLO YAA MALAAA-EKATAL LAAHE\nMay I enter, O angels of Allah\nالْمُوَكَّلِينَ بِهٰذَا الْحَرَمِ الشَّرِيفِ\nALMOWAKKALEENA BE-HAAZAL HARAMISH SHAREEFE\nwhom are assigned to manage this holy sanctuary?\nYou may then enter the holy shrine preceding your right foot to the left. When you stop on the tomb of Imam Abul-Hasan al-Hadi, peace be upon him, directing your face towards the tomb and your back towards the kiblah direction, you may repeat one hundred times:\nاَللّٰهُ اكْبَرُ\nALLAAHO AKBARO\nAllah is the Most Great.\nYou may then say the following\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا اَبَا الْحَسَنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ABAL HASANE\nPeace be upon you, O Abul-Hasan\nعَلِيُّ بْنَ مُحَمَّدٍ\nA’LIYYUBNA MOHAMMADIN\nAli the son of Muhammad,\nالزَّكِيُّ الرَّاشِدُ\nAZZAKIYYUR RAASHEDO\nthe pious, right-directing,\nالنُّورُ الثَّاقِبُ\nANNOORUS SAAQEBO\nand brightly shining light.\nوَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nAllahs mercy and blessings be upon you.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَفِيَّ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAFIYYAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O sincerely attached friend of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سِرَّ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SIRRAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O confidant of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَبْلَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HABLAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O rope of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا آلَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AALAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O household of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا خِيَرةَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA KHEYARATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O select of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا صَفْوَةَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SAFWATAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O choice of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا امِينَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA AMEENAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O trustee of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَقَّ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HAQQAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O proof of Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَبِيبَ اللّٰهِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HABEEBAL LAAHE\nPeace be upon you, O most-beloved by Allah.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا نُورَ الانْوَارِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA NOORAL ANWAARE\nPeace be upon you, O light of the lights.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا زَيْنَ الابْرَارِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA ZAYNAL ABRAARE\nPeace be upon you, O pride of the virtuous ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا سَلِيلَ الاخْيَارِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA SALEELAL AKHYAARE\nPeace be upon you, O descendant of the upright ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عُنْصُرَ الاطْهَارِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA U’NSORAL AT-HAARE\nPeace be upon you, O essence of the purified ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حُجَّةَ الرَّحْمٰنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HUJJATAR RAHMAANE\nPeace be upon you, O argument of the All-beneficent God.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا رُكْنَ الاِيمَانِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA RUKNAL EEMAANE\nPeace be upon you, O essence of the true faith.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا مَوْلَىٰ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA MAWLAL MOAMENEENA\nPeace be upon you, O master of the believers.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا وَلِيَّ الصَّالِحِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA WALIYYAS SAALEHEENA\nPeace be upon you, O guardian of the righteous ones.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَلَمَ الْهُدَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA A’LAMAL HODAA\nPeace be upon you, O symbol of true guidance.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا حَلِيفَ التُّقَىٰ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA HALEEFAT TOQAA\nPeace be upon you, O ally of piety.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا عَمُودَ الدِّينِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YAA A’MOODAD DEENE\nPeace be upon you, O mainstay of the religion.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ خَاتَمِ النَّبِيِّينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA KHAATAMIN NABIYYEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the seal of the Prophets.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ سَيِّدِ الْوَصِيِّينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA SAYYEDIL WASIYYEENA\nPeace be upon you, O son of the chief of the Prophets successors.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ يَا بْنَ فَاطِمَةَ الزَّهْرَاءِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA YABNA FAATEMATAZ ZAHRAAA-E\nPeace be upon you, O son of Fatimah the Luminous\nسَيِّدَةِ نِسَاءِ الْعَالَمِينَ\nSAYYEDATE NESAAA-IL A’ALAMEENA\nand the doyenne of the women of the world.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الامِينُ الْوَفِيُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL AMEENUL WAFIYYO\nPeace be upon you, O faithful trustee.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْعَلَمُ الرَّضِيُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL A’LAMUR RAZIYYO\nPeace be upon you, O favorite epitome.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الزَّاهِدُ التَّقِيُّ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAZ ZAAHEDUT TAQIYYO\nPeace be upon you, O ascetic and pious.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْحُجَّةُ عَلَىٰ الْخَلْقِ اَجْمَعِينَ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL HUJJATO A’LAL KHALQE AJMA-E’ENA\nPeace be upon you, O decisive argument against all creatures.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا التَّالِي لِلْقُرْآنِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAT TAALEE LILQUR-AANE\nPeace be upon you, O reciter of the Qur'an.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْمُبَيِّنُ لِلْحَلَالِ مِنَ الْحَرَامِ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL MOBAYYENO LILHALAALE MENAL HARAAME\nPeace be upon you, O distinguishing between the lawful and the unlawful.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الْوَلِيُّ النَّاصِحُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAL WALIYYUN NAASEHO\nPeace be upon you, O sincere saint.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا الطَّرِيقُ الْوَاضِحُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAT TAREEQUL WAAZEHO\nPeace be upon you, O evident course.\nاَلسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ اَيُّهَا النَّجْمُ اللَّائِحُ\nASSALAAMO A’LAYKA AYYOHAN NAJMUL LAAA-EHO\nPeace be upon you, O bright star.\nاَشْهَدُ يَا مَوْلَايَ يَا اَبَا الْحَسَنِ\nASH-HADO YAA MAWLAAYA YAA ABAL HASANE\nI bear witness, O my master Abul-Hasan,\nاِنَّكَ حُجَّةُ اللّٰهِ عَلَىٰ خَلْقِهٖ\nANNAKA HUJJATUL LAAHE A’LAA KHALQEHI\nthat you are verily the decisive argument of Allah against His creatures,\nوَخَلِيفَتُهٗ فِي بَرِيَّتِهٖ\nWA KHALEEFATOHU FEE BARIYYATEHI\nHis representative among His created beings,\nوَامِينُهٗ فِي بِلَادِهٖ\nWA AMEENOHU FEE BELAADEHI\nHis trusted administrator in His lands,\nوَشَاهِدُهٗ عَلَىٰ عِبَادِهٖ\nWA SHAAHEDOHU A’LAA E’BAADEHI\nand His witness over His servants.\nوَاشْهَدُ اِنَّكَ كَلِمَةُ التَّقْوَىٰ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKA KALEMATUT TAQWAA\nI also bear witness that you are verily the word of piety,\nوَبَابُ الْهُدَىٰ\nWA BAABUL HODAA\nthe door to true guidance,\nوَالْعُرْوَةُ الْوُثْقَىٰ\nWAL U’RWATUL WUSQAA\nthe Firmest Handle,\nوَالْحُجَّةُ عَلَىٰ مَنْ فَوْقَ الارْضِ\nWAL HUJJATO A’LAA MAN FAWQAL ARZE\nand the evident proof against those who are on the earth\nوَمَنْ تَحْتَ الثَّرَىٰ\nWA MAN TAHTAS SARAA\nand those who are beneath the layers of the soil.\nوَاشْهَدُ اِنَّكَ الْمُطَهَّرُ مِنَ الذُّنُوبِ\nWA ASH-HADO ANNAKAL MOTAHHARO MENAZ ZONOOBE\nI bear witness that you are purified from sins,\nالْمُبَرَّا مِنَ الْعُيُوبِ\nALMOBARRAA MENAL O’YOOBE\ncleaned against defects,\nوَالْمُخْتَصُّ بِكَرَامَةِ اللّٰهِ\nWAL MUKHTASSO BE-KARAAMATIL LAAHE\nbestowed with the honor of Allah,\nوَالْمَحْبُوُّ بِحُجَّةِ اللّٰهِ\nWAL MAHBUWWO BE-HUJJATIL LAAHE\nendued with the proof of Allah,\nوَالْمَوْهُوبُ لَهٗ كَلِمَةُ اللّٰهِ\nWAL MAWHOOBO LAHU KALEMATUL LAAHE\ngranted the Word of Allah,\nوَالرُّكْنُ الَّذِي يَلْجَا اِِلَيْهِ الْعِبَادُ\nWAR RUKNUL LAZEE YALJAA ELAYHIL E’BAADO\nand the stronghold to whom the servants (of Allah) resort\nوَتُحْيَىٰ بِهِ الْبِلَادُ\nWA TOHYAA BEHIL BELAADO\nand by whom the lands are revived.\nوَاشْهَدُ يَا مَوْلَايَ\nWA ASH-HADO YAA MAWLAAYA\nI bear witness, O my master,\nانِّي بِكَ وَبِآبَائِكَ وَابْنَائِكَ مُوقِنٌ مُقِرٌّ\nANNEE BEKA WA BE-AABAAA-EKA WA ABNAAA-EKA MOOQENUM MOQIRRUN\nthat I have faith in and I submit to you, your forefathers and your sons,\nوَلَكُمْ تَابِعٌ فِي ذَاتِ نَفْسِي\nWA LAKUM TAABE-U’N FEE ZAATE NAFSEE\nI follow all of you in my personal affairs,\nوَشَرَايِعِ دِينِي\nWA SHARAAYE-E’ DEENEE\nin my religious performance,\nوَخَاتِمَةِ عَمَلِي\nWA KHAATEMATE A’MALEE\nin the seals of my deed,\nوَمُنْقَلَبِي وَمَثْوَايَ\nWA MUNQALABEE WA MASWAAYA\nand in my return and final place.\nوَانِّي وَلِيٌّ لِمَنْ وَالَاكُمْ\nWA ANNEE WALIYYUL LEMANW WAALAAKUM\nI do show loyalty to your loyalists,\nوَعَدُوٌّ لِمَنْ عَادَاكُمْ\nWA A’DUWWUL LEMAN A’ADAAKUM\nI show enmity towards your enemies,\nمُؤْمِنٌ بِسِرِّكُمْ وَعَلَانِيَتِكُمْ\nMOAMENUN BE-SIRREKUM WA A’LAANEYATEKUM\nI believe in all of the invisible and the visible,\nوَاوَّلِكُمْ وَآخِرِكُمْ\nWA AWWALEKUM WA AAKHEREKUM\nand the first and the last of you.\nبِابِي انْتَ وَامِّي\nBE-ABEE ANTA WA UMMEE\nMay Allah accept my father and mother as ransoms for you.\nوَالسَّلَامُ عَلَيْكَ وَرَحْمَةُ اللّٰهِ وَبَرَكَاتُهٗ\nWAS SALAAMO A’LAYKA WA RAHMATUL LAAHE WA BARAKAATOHU\nPeace and Allahs mercy and blessings be upon you.\nYou may then kiss the tomb and place your right and then left cheeks on it and say the following words:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ مُحَمَّدٍ وَآلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA MOHAMMADINW WA AALE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad\nوَصَلِّ عَلَىٰ حُجَّتِكَ الْوَفِيِّ\nWA SALLE A’LAA HUJJATEKAL WAFIYYE\nand send blessings upon Your faithful demonstrator,\nوَوَلِيِّكَ الزَّكِيِّ\nWA WALIYYEKAZ ZAKIYYE\nYour sagacious representative,\nوَامِينِكَ الْمُرْتَضَىٰ\nWA AMEENEKAL MURTAZAA\nYour well-pleased trustee,\nوَصَفِيِّكَ الْهَادِي\nWA SAFIYYEKAL HAADEE\nYour sincerely attached guide,\nوَصِرَاطِكَ الْمُسْتَقِيمِ\nWA SERAATEKAL MUSTAQEEME\nYour Right Path,\nوَالْجَادَّةِ الْعُظْمَىٰ\nWAL JAADDATIL U’ZMAA\nthe most important approach,\nوَالطَّرِيقَةِ الْوُسْطَىٰ\nWAT TAREEQATIL WUSTAA\nthe just and equitable course,\nنُورِ قُلُوبِ الْمُؤْمِنِينَ\nNOORE QOLOOBIL MOAMENEENA\nthe light of the faithful believers hearts,\nوَوَلِيِّ الْمُتَّقِينَ\nWA WALIYYIL MUTTAQEENA\nthe friend of the pious ones,\nوَصَاحِبِ الْمُخْلِصِينَ\nWA SAAHEBIL MUKHLESEENA\nand the comrade of the sincere.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ سَيِّدِنَا مُحَمَّدٍ وَاهْلِ بَيْتِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA SAYYEDENAA MOHAMMADINW WA AHLE BAYTEHI\nO Allah, (please do) send blessings upon our Master Muhammad and upon his Household\nوَصَلِّ عَلَىٰ عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA SALLE A’LAA A’LIYYIBNE MOHAMMADIN\nand send blessings upon Ali the son of Muhammad,\nالرَّاشِدِ الْمَعْصُومِ مِنَ الزَّلَلِ\nARRAASHEDIL MA’SOOME MENAZ ZALALE\nthe rightly-directing, the infallible guide,\nوَالطَّاهِرِ مِنَ الْخَلَلِ\nWAT TAAHERE MENAL KHALALE\nthe free from defects,\nوَالْمُنْقَطِعِ اِِلَيْكَ بِالامَلِ\nWAL MUNQATE-E’ ELAYKA BIL-AMALE\nwho, putting hope in You, kept himself aloof from temptations,\nالْمَبْلُوِّ بِالْفِتَنِ\nALMABLUWWE BIL-FETANE\nwho was tried (by You) through seditious matters,\nوَالْمُخْتَبَرِ بِالْمِحَنِ\nWAL MUKHTABARE BIL-MEHANE\nwho was tested (by You) through tribulations,\nوَالْمُمْتَحَنِ بِحُسْنِ الْبَلْوَىٰ\nWAL MUMTAHANE BE-HUSNIL BALWAA\nwho was examined (by You) through acting excellently towards misfortunes,\nوَصَبْرِ الشَّكْوَىٰ\nWA SABRISH SHAKWAA\nand through steadfastness against complaining;\nمُرْشِدِ عِبَادِكَ\nMURSHEDE E’BAADEKA\n(he is) the spiritual guide of Your servants,\nوَبَرَكَةِ بِلَادِكَ\nWA BARAKATE BELAADEKA\nthe blessing for Your lands,\nوَمَحَلِّ رَحْمَتِكَ\nWA MAHALLE RAHMATEKA\nthe destination of Your mercy,\nومُسْتَوْدَعِ حِكْمَتِكَ\nWA MUSTAWDA-E’ HIKMATEKA\nthe hoarder of Your wisdom,\nوَالْقَائِدِ اِلَىٰ جَنَّتِكَ\nWAL QAAA-EDE ELAA JANNATEKA\nthe leader to Your Paradise,\nالْعَالِمِ فِي بَرِيَّتِكَ\nAL-A’ALEME FEE BARIYYATEKA\nthe all-knowledgeable among Your created beings,\nوَالْهَادِي فِي خَلِيقَتِكَ\nWAL HAADEE FEE KHALEEQATEKA\nthe true guide of Your creatures,\nالَّذِي ارْتَضَيْتَهٗ وَانْتَجَبْتَهٗ\nALLAZIR TAZAYTAHU WAN TAJABTAHU\nwhom You pleased, preferred,\nوَاخْتَرْتَهٗ لِمَقَامِ رَسُولِكَ فِي امَّتِهٖ\nWAKH TARTAHU LE-MAQAAME RASOOLEKA FEE UMMATEHI\nselected to take the place of Your Prophet among his people,\nوَالْزَمْتَهٗ حِفْظَ شَرِيعَتِهٖ\nWA ALZAMTAHU HIFZA SHAREE-A’TEHI\nand bounded with the guardianship of his laws.\nفَاسْتَقَلَّ بِاعْبَاءِ الْوَصِيَّةِ\nFASTAQALLA BE-A-A’BAAA-IL WASIYYATE\nSo, he accomplished the onerous task of representation (of the Prophet),\nنَاهِضاً بِهَا\nNAAHEZAN BEHAA\ncarrying it perfectly,\nومُضْطَلِعاً بِحَمْلِهَا\nWA MUZTALE-A’N BE-HAMLEHAA\nand undertaking the responsibility of bearing it.\nلَمْ يَعْثُرْ فِي مُشْكِلٍ\nLAM YA’SUR FEE MUSHKELIN\nHe neither slipped in any problematic action\nوَلَا هَفَا فِي مُعْضِلٍ\nWA LAA HAFAA FEE MO’ZELIN\nnor did he fail to solve any complexity.\nبَلْ كَشَفَ الْغُمَّةَ\nBAL KASHAFAL GHUMMATA\nRather, he relieved all agonies,\nوَسَدَّ الْفُرْجَةَ\nWA SADDAL FURJATA\nsealed the loopholes,\nوَادَّىٰ الْمُفْتَرَضَ\nWA ADDAL MUFTARAZA\nand fulfilled the required.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَكَمَا اقْرَرْتَ نَاظِرَ نَبِيِّكَ بِهٖ\nALLAAHUMMA FAKAMAA AQRARTA NAAZERA NABIYYEKA BEHI\nO Allah, just as You made him a source of delight for Your Prophet,\nفَرَقِّهٖ دَرَجَتَهٗ\nFARAQQEHI DARAJATAHU\nso also (please) raise him to the most elevated position,\nوَاجْزِلْ لَدَيْكَ مَثُوبَتَهٗ\nWA AJZIL LADAYKA MASOOBATAHU\ngive him the most fitting reward that suits him,\nوَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ\nWA SALLE A’LAYHE\nbless him,\nوَبَلِّغْهُ مِنَّا تَحِيَّةً وَسَلَاماً\nWA BALLIGH-HO MINNAA TAHIYYATANW WA SALAAMAN\nconvey our greetings and salutations to him,\nوَآتِنَا مِنْ لَدُنْكَ فِي مُوَالَاتِهٖ فَضْلَاً وَاِِحْسَاناً\nWA AATENAA MIL LADUNKA FEE MOWAALAATEHI FAZLANW WA EHSAANAN\nand give us, on account of our love for him, from You bounties, favors,\nوَمَغْفِرَةً وَرِضْوَاناً\nWA MAGHFERATANW WA RIZWAANAN\namnesty, and approval.\nاِِنَّكَ ذُو الْفَضْلِ الْعَظِيمِ\nINNAKA ZUL FAZLIL A’ZEEME\nVerily, You are the Lord of superabundant favors.",
  "tabs": [
    "Salawat Upon Imam al-Naqi\nاَللّٰهُمَّ صَلِّ عَلَىٰ عَلِيِّ بْنِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nALLAAHUMMA SALLE A’LAA A’LIYYIBNE MOHAMMADIN\nO Allah, (please) send blessings upon `Ali the son of Muhammad,\nوَصِيِّ الَاوْصِيَاءِ\nWASIYYIL AWSEYAAA-E\nthe successor of the Successors,\nوَاِمَامِ الَاتْقِيَاءِ\nWA EMAAMIL ATQEYAAA-E\nthe leader of the pious,\nوَخَلَفِ اَئِمَّةِ الدِّينِ\nWA KHALAFE A-IMMATID DEENE\nthe descendant of the leaders of the religion,\nوَالْحُجَّةِ عَلَىٰ الْخَلَائِقِ اَجْمَعِينَ\nWAL HUJJATE A’LAL KHALAAA-EQE AJMA-E’ENA\nand the argument against all of the creatures.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ كَمَا جَعَلْتَهٗ نُوراً يَسْتَضِيءُ بِهِ الْمُؤْمِنُونَ\nALLAAHUMMA KAMAA JA-A’LTAHU NOORAN-Y YASTAZEE-O BEHIL MOAMENOONA\nO Allah, as You have made him the source of light from which the believers derive light,\nفَبَشَّرَ بِالْجَزِيلِ مِنْ ثَوَابِكَ\nFABASH-SHARA BIL-JAZEELE MIN SAWAABEKA\nand so he conveyed the good tidings of Your abundant reward,\nوَاَنْذَرَ بِالَالِيمِ مِنْ عِقَابِكَ\nWA ANZARA BIL-ALEEME MIN E’QAABEKA\nwarned against Your painful punishment,\nوَحَذَّرَ بَاْسَكَ\nWA HAZZARA BAASAKA\nnotified against Your prowess,\nوَذَكَّرَ بِآيَاتِكَ\nWA ZAKKARA BE-AAYAATEKA\nreminded of Your signs,\nوَاَحَلَّ حَلَالَكَ\nWA AHALLA HALAALAKA\nrendered legal that which You have deemed legal,\nوَحَرَّمَ حَرَامَكَ\nWA HARRAMA HARAAMAKA\nrendered illegal that which You have deemed illegal,\nوَبَيَّنَ شَرَائِعَكَ وَفَرَائِضَكَ\nWA BAYYANA SHARAAA-E-A’KA WA FARAAA-EZAKA\nexplained Your laws and the duties towards You,\nوَحَضَّ عَلَىٰ عِبَادَتِكَ\nWA HAZZA A’LAA E’BAADATEKA\nencouraged on servitude to You,\nوَاَمَرَ بِطَاعَتِكَ\nWA AMARA BE-TAA-A’TEKA\nenjoined obedience to You,\nوَنَهَىٰ عَنْ مَعْصِيَتِكَ\nWA NAHAA A’M MA’SEYATEKA\nand forbade disobedience to You,\nفَصَلِّ عَلَيْهِ\nFASALLE A’LAYHE\nso also (please) bless him\nاَفْضَلَ مَا صَلَّيْتَ عَلَىٰ اَحَدٍ\nAFZALA MAA SALLAYTA A’LAA AHADIN\nwith the most favorite blessings that You have ever bestowed\nمِنْ اَوْلِيَائِكَ وَذُرِّيَّةِ اَنْبِيَائِكَ\nMIN AWLEYAAA-EKA WA ZURRIYYATE ANBEYAAA-EKA\nupon any of Your intimate servants and descendants of Your Prophets.\nيَا اِلٰهَ الْعَالَمِينَ\nYAA ELAAHAL A’ALAMEENA\nO God of the Worlds!"
